# UI system for the walker example (#549).
#
# uiUpdate runs the per-frame UI/settings/panel handling — device input into the
# ECS UI world, the clip + transport panels, the settings dialog, and the UI
# layout systems — extracted verbatim from updateApp with behaviour unchanged.
# It returns a UiTick because two of its outcomes (settingsChanged and scrolled)
# feed the render decision back in updateApp. It mutates app.character / app.cam
# / app.render as the inline code did.
#
# The UI STATE still lives in app.rae's InputUi type (input + ui combined); the
# InputUi -> InputState/UiState split rides with #545 (input intent), which owns
# that decomposition. Example-114 files are siblings in one module, so App and
# the sibling/stdlib helpers resolve cross-file.

